questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a Spring Boot web application experiences a continuous heap memory leak under high load. Memory dumps reveal millions of lingering `UserContext` instances held inside worker threads. The following Spring AOP aspect is used to handle security context propagation:

java
@Aspect
@Component
public class SecurityContextAspect {
    private static final ThreadLocal<UserContext> CONTEXT_HOLDER = new ThreadLocal<>();

    @Around("@annotation(RequiresSecurityContext)")
    public Object manageContext(ProceedingJoinPoint joinPoint) throws Throwable {
        UserContext context = extractContext(joinPoint);
        CONTEXT_HOLDER.set(context);
        return joinPoint.proceed();
    }
}
